  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Finland&#x2019;s Pre-Departure Orientation Program 2021-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project enhances Finland-bound quota refugees&#x2019; integration capacity and promotes their resettlement by responding to their information needs regarding the Finnish society and by empowering them to take active role in their own integration processes. The project targets all quota refugees to be resettled in Finland during the project period excluding emergency cases.</narrative>
  </description>
